---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import BrandLogo from "../components/BrandLogo.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Brand — A3S Labs" description="A3S Labs identity system: logo orientations, colors, responsive application and downloadable production assets." canonicalPath="/brand">
  <section class="section-pad page-hero"><div class="shell brand-page-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span>A3S / BRAND</span><span>IDENTITY SYSTEM</span></p><h1>One identity across every surface.</h1><p class="hero-lede">A modular signal mark, graphite-and-lime palette and responsive lockups connect A3S products, applied intelligence, infrastructure and research under one visual system.</p><div class="brand-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#assets">Get brand assets <span>↓</span></a><a class="button button-quiet" href="/contact">Contact A3S Labs</a></div></div><div class="brand-page-banner"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-brand-banner.svg" alt="A3S Labs brand banner" width="1600" height="720" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule"><div class="shell"><header class="section-heading split-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">Logo system</p><h2>Built for width, height and constrained interfaces.</h2></div><p>Use the horizontal identity when width is available, the stacked lockup in vertical compositions, and the mark alone at compact sizes.</p></header><div class="brand-spec-grid">
    <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal.svg" alt="A3S Labs horizontal logo" /></div><h2>Primary horizontal</h2><p>Desktop navigation, documents, wide banners and product attribution.</p></article>
    <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-stacked.svg" alt="A3S Labs stacked logo" /></div><h2>Stacked</h2><p>Footer identity, square panels, presentation covers and vertical placements.</p></article>
    <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><BrandLogo variant="mark" /></div><h2>Mark</h2><p>Favicons, app icons, mobile navigation, avatars and compact surfaces.</p></article>
    <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media is-dark"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal-on-dark.svg" alt="A3S Labs logo on a dark surface" /></div><h2>Dark surface</h2><p>Warm-neutral identity strokes preserve contrast while acid lime remains unchanged.</p></article>
    <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal.svg" alt="A3S Labs logo on a light surface" /></div><h2>Light surface</h2><p>Graphite carries the identity on warm-neutral and light backgrounds.</p></article>
    <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><img src="/android-chrome-192x192.png" alt="A3S Labs application icon" /></div><h2>Application icon</h2><p>The generated mark remains identifiable from browser favicon to installed-app surfaces.</p></article>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="section-pad capability-band"><div class="shell brand-usage-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">Core palette</p><h2>Three colors. One system.</h2></div><div class="brand-palette"><div class="brand-swatch"><div class="brand-swatch-chip" style="background:#C6FF00"></div><b>Acid Lime</b><code>#C6FF00</code></div><div class="brand-swatch"><div class="brand-swatch-chip" style="background:#111416"></div><b>Graphite</b><code>#111416</code></div><div class="brand-swatch"><div class="brand-swatch-chip" style="background:#F4F2EE"></div><b>Warm Neutral</b><code>#F4F2EE</code></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule"><div class="shell brand-usage-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">Responsive application</p><h2>Full lockup when space exists. Mark when it does not.</h2><p class="brand-bundle-note">The production site follows this rule directly: desktop gets the horizontal identity; compact/mobile navigation drops to the standalone mark.</p></div><div class="brand-device-row"><div class="brand-device"><div class="brand-device-head"><span>Desktop</span><span>Horizontal</span></div><div class="brand-device-header"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal-on-dark.svg" alt="" /><span class="brand-device-menu"></span></div></div><div class="brand-device brand-device-mobile"><div class="brand-device-head"><span>Mobile</span><span>Mark</span></div><div class="brand-device-header"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-mark-on-dark.svg" alt="" /><span class="brand-device-menu"></span></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section-pad detail-band"><div class="shell brand-usage-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">Usage rules</p><h2>Recognition comes from consistency.</h2></div><div class="brand-rule-list"><div><span>01</span><p>Preserve supplied proportions; do not stretch, squash, rotate or redraw the mark.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>Keep acid lime unchanged. It is the signal color connecting the parent identity across products.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>Use the supplied light- or dark-surface lockup instead of adding shadows, outlines or improvised recoloring.</p></div><div><span>04</span><p>At compact sizes, drop the wordmark before shrinking it beyond legibility.</p></div><div><span>05</span><p>Maintain clear space around the logo roughly equal to the central node diameter.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule" id="assets"><div class="shell"><header class="section-heading split-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">Production assets</p><h2>Download by intended use.</h2></div><p>SVG lockups scale without resolution loss. PNG icon derivatives cover browser and mobile metadata.</p></header><div class="brand-download-grid"><a href="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal.svg" download><span>Horizontal / light</span><span>SVG ↓</span></a><a href="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal-on-dark.svg" download><span>Horizontal / dark</span><span>SVG ↓</span></a><a href="/brand/a3s-labs-stacked.svg" download><span>Stacked / light</span><span>SVG ↓</span></a><a href="/brand/a3s-labs-stacked-on-dark.svg" download><span>Stacked / dark</span><span>SVG ↓</span></a><a href="/brand/a3s-labs-mark.svg" download><span>Standalone mark</span><span>SVG ↓</span></a><a href="/brand/a3s-labs-social-card.svg" download><span>Social card</span><span>1200×630 ↓</span></a><a href="/favicon-32x32.png" download><span>Browser icon</span><span>32px PNG ↓</span></a><a href="/apple-touch-icon.png" download><span>Apple touch</span><span>180px PNG ↓</span></a><a href="/android-chrome-192x192.png" download><span>Android icon</span><span>192px PNG ↓</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
